    "Three days of floor time in front of buyers who came to Nairobi specifically to source.": "三天展位时间,面向专程来到Nairobi采购的买家。",
    "The expo runs alongside the summit and opens fully on day three. It is not a general trade fair — the audience is the delegate list, which means the people walking your stand are the buyers, investors and processors who registered for the forums.": "博览会与峰会同期举行,并在第三天全面开放。这不是一个普通的贸易展会——观众是代表名单,这意味着走进您展位的人是注册参加论坛的买家、投资者和加工商。",
    "What can be exhibited": "可展出内容",
    "<span class=\"class-row__code\">Class 1</span>\n    <span class=\"class-row__name\">Tea products</span>\n    <p>Black, green, orthodox, speciality, purple, blended and branded lines. Finished goods and bulk.</p>": "<span class=\"class-row__code\">第1类</span>\n    <span class=\"class-row__name\">茶叶产品</span>\n    <p>红茶、绿茶、传统工艺茶、特种茶、紫茶、拼配茶和品牌茶系列。成品和散装。</p>",
    "<span class=\"class-row__code\">Class 2</span>\n    <span class=\"class-row__name\">Processing equipment</span>\n    <p>Withering, rolling, oxidation, drying, sorting, grading and packing machinery.</p>": "<span class=\"class-row__code\">第2类</span>\n    <span class=\"class-row__name\">加工设备</span>\n    <p>萎凋、揉捻、氧化、干燥、筛分、分级和包装机械。</p>",
    "<span class=\"class-row__code\">Class 3</span>\n    <span class=\"class-row__name\">Agricultural technologies</span>\n    <p>Inputs, irrigation, mechanised plucking, soil and yield analytics, traceability systems.</p>": "<span class=\"class-row__code\">第3类</span>\n    <span class=\"class-row__name\">农业技术</span>\n    <p>农业投入品、灌溉、机械化采摘、土壤和产量分析、可追溯系统。</p>",
    "<span class=\"class-row__code\">Class 4</span>\n    <span class=\"class-row__name\">Logistics services</span>\n    <p>Freight, warehousing, cold chain, customs and export documentation.</p>": "<span class=\"class-row__code\">第4类</span>\n    <span class=\"class-row__name\">物流服务</span>\n    <p>货运、仓储、冷链、海关和出口文件。</p>",
    "Why exhibit at this one": "为什么要在这个展会参展",
    "Most tea trade shows put you in front of the tea trade in general. This one is built around a single corridor — Kenya to China — at a moment when that corridor is unsettled. Kenyan exports to China fell 51% in the first quarter of 2026, while national policy targets a large increase in green and orthodox production and China holds a zero-tariff door open.": "大多数茶叶贸易展会让您面对整个茶叶贸易行业。而这个展会是围绕单一走廊——肯尼亚到中国——在这条走廊出现不稳定的时刻而设立的。肯尼亚对中国的出口在2026年第一季度下降了51%,而国家政策目标是大幅增加绿茶和传统工艺茶的产量,中国则开放了零关税的大门。",
    "Sources: <a href=\"https://kenyanwallstreet.com/tea-exports-q1-2026\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">The Kenyan Wall Street</a>, Q1 2026 · <a href=\"https://www.chinadaily.com.cn/a/202607/21/WS6a5ec8f3a310986e2b466594.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">China Daily</a>, 21 July 2026": "来源:<a href=\"https://kenyanwallstreet.com/tea-exports-q1-2026\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">The Kenyan Wall Street</a>,2026年第一季度 · <a href=\"https://www.chinadaily.com.cn/a/202607/21/WS6a5ec8f3a310986e2b466594.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">China Daily</a>,2026年7月21日",
    "If you sell into that gap — machinery that moves a producer from bulk black into orthodox, traceability that satisfies a Chinese importer, freight that shortens the route — the people making those decisions are in the building for three days.": "如果您的产品能填补这一缺口——帮助生产商从散装红茶转向传统工艺茶的机械、满足中国进口商要求的可追溯系统、缩短运输路线的货运——那么做出这些决策的人将在大楼里停留三天。",
